# Project Orientation — {{CAMPAIGN_TITLE}}

The campaign's north star: **the end goal, the decision it drives, the loosely-held expectations to test,
and the numbered task hierarchy** — each task tied to *how it serves the goal*. Read at the start of a
session and revisited at every checkpoint. Where the `frame-problem` decomposition graduates and where
`campaign-status` re-checks orientation. Keep it lean; it steers, it doesn't narrate (the logbook narrates).

