## Task hierarchy (goal-linked; status + verification)
Numbered tasks, each with **how it serves the goal** and **its verification status**. Decompose into small,
agile steps; verify between the steps that matter (a step a later one depends on, or where error compounds)
— proportional to risk, not after every trivial step. Update status as work proceeds.

> Status: ☐ todo · ◐ in-progress · ☑ done · ⏸ parked · ✗ dropped (with reason)

